  "term": "effect",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, an effect is the influence one factor has on another. Here it refers to how perceived teacher support is linked with lower online academic burnout, both through a direct protective influence and through related processes such as stronger self-efficacy, better emotional regulation, and greater acceptance of online learning.",
